---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import FAQ from '../components/FAQ.astro';
import CategoryHub from '../components/v2/templates/CategoryHub.astro';
import { siteImages } from '../data/images';
import { getPageSEO } from '../utils/seo';
const pageSEO = getPageSEO('decorations');

const cards = [
  { title: 'Tiles', description: 'Explore surface customization and its role in restaurant layout planning.', href: '/decorations/tiles/', icon: 'T' },
  { title: 'Counter Planning', description: 'Learn how counter placement supports an organized kitchen workspace.', href: '/guides/counter-upgrades/', icon: 'C' },
  { title: 'Choopy Mystery Box', description: 'Learn how the Choopy interface fits into restaurant customization.', href: '/guides/choopy-mystery-box/', icon: 'M' },
];

const faqItems = [
  { question: 'What does the Decorations section cover?', answer: 'It organizes customization topics currently documented by the Wiki, including Tiles, Counter information, and Choopy.' },
  { question: 'Where can I learn about Tiles?', answer: 'Open the Tiles page for an introduction to surface customization and layout use.' },
  { question: 'Are Decorations the same as Furniture?', answer: 'No. Furniture covers functional dining-area items, while Decorations focuses on visual customization. Both can be considered together when planning a restaurant layout.' },
];
---

<BaseLayout pageId="decorations" breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: pageSEO.h1 }]}>
<CategoryHub
  title={pageSEO.h1}
  kicker="Customization directory"
  intro="Browse Karinderya customization topics, including the current Wiki pages for Tiles, counters, and Choopy."
  copyHeading="Introduction"
  cards={cards}
  relatedLinks={[
    { label: 'Furniture', href: '/furniture/' },
    { label: 'Tiles', href: '/decorations/tiles/' },
    { label: 'Restaurant Layout Guide', href: '/guides/restaurant-layout/' },
    { label: 'Counter Planning', href: '/guides/counter-upgrades/' },
  ]}
  heroImage={siteImages.decorationsHero}
  tableOfContents
  relatedHeading="Explore Related Sections"
  adSlots
>
  <p>The Decorations Hub separates visual customization from Furniture and restaurant Equipment. It provides navigation to the customization topics currently covered by the Wiki without assigning hidden effects to decorative choices.</p>

  <h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
  <p>Use this hub to find Tiles, counter information, and the Choopy guide. Each linked page explains its own topic and keeps version-specific update history separate from general customization guidance.</p>

  <h2 id="customization-directory">Customization Directory</h2>
  <ul><li><a href="/decorations/tiles/">Tiles</a> covers surface customization.</li><li>The <a href="/guides/counter-upgrades/">Counter guide</a> covers the current Wiki information about counter changes.</li><li>The <a href="/guides/choopy-mystery-box/">Choopy guide</a> covers the Choopy interface and the limits of the available information.</li></ul>

  <h2 id="update-context">Related Update</h2>
  <p>The <a href="/updates/decorations-part-1/">Decorations Part 1 update record</a> separates the dated update evidence from the player-focused pages in this directory.</p>

  <h2 id="layout-planning">Layout Planning</h2>
  <p>Plan decorations around the restaurant's functional areas. Keep the dining area readable, leave the kitchen workflow clear, and use a consistent visual direction so customization supports the overall layout.</p>

  <h2 id="gameplay-tips">Gameplay Tips</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Decide which area of the restaurant you want to organize before changing its appearance.</li>
    <li>Keep movement paths visible while arranging decorative elements.</li>
    <li>Use the Furniture directory for tables and chairs rather than mixing those entries into this section.</li>
    <li>Review the Restaurant Layout Guide when planning several areas at once.</li>
  </ul>

  <FAQ items={faqItems} />
</CategoryHub>
</BaseLayout>
